            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Music? (la musique.) Sport? (le sport.) A game? (le jeu.) A film? (le film.) A song? (la chanson.) A drawing? (le dessin.) Life? (la vie.) A time? (la fois.) A colour? (la couleur.) A price; a prize? (le prix.) Pink? (rose.) Purple? (violet.) Brown? (marron.) Brown? (brun.) Pretty? (joli.) Busy? (occupé.) Free? (libre.) Open? (ouvert.) Closed? (fermé.) Calm? (calme.) Noisy? (bruyant.) Last? (dernier.) Next? (prochain.) Famous? (célèbre.) Funny? (drôle.)"
